help new knowledge.stdout:
usage: mem new knowledge [-h] [--body-file PATH] --slug SLUG --claim CLAIM
                         --topics TOPICS --confidence {high,medium,low}
                         --level {basic,beginner,intermediate,advanced,expert,niche}
                         --origin {literature,research,experience}
                         [--part-of s:HANDLE#SECTION] [--owner-approved]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --body-file PATH      text (or - for standard input) that replaces the
                        template body
  --slug SLUG
  --claim CLAIM
  --topics TOPICS
  --confidence {high,medium,low}
  --level {basic,beginner,intermediate,advanced,expert,niche}
  --origin {literature,research,experience}
  --part-of s:HANDLE#SECTION
                        the synthesis section this note summarizes
  --owner-approved      the owner agreed to a write that mentions a soft term:
                        never add it on your own
